{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3735860/extras/c84eb145d76dc3080d5180368699c85b.poster.avif?t=1773483137\" width=920 height=518 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3735860/extras/c84eb145d76dc3080d5180368699c85b.webm?t=1773483137\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3735860/extras/c84eb145d76dc3080d5180368699c85b.mp4?t=1773483137\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3735860/extras/d3f9e6938c26ef07bcd235d141843274.avif?t=1773483137\" width=1600 height=400 /></span>An Ever-Changing World</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Lands of Marana are five continents filled with dangerous monsters, challenging bosses, and mysterious secrets. Every choice you make will change the fates of all characters and foes as the world shifts and your story gets written.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3735860/extras/0eff10ef04236a7d374c4b9d7a59e0df.avif?t=1773483137\" width=1600 height=400 /></span>Differences in Combat</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each class in Havoc Heirs offers unique abilities that separate their playstyles. Powerful rings that can be equipped and permanent Blessings that can be acquired further offer a wide variety of playable builds. </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3735860/extras/cb8a908e3f45f764e5ec313e3e9f8999.avif?t=1773483137\" width=1600 height=400 /></span>A Heavy Heart and Heavier Mind</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Monsters have had their minds corrupted by Psychosis, a dark force that makes them vicious and unyielding. Every time you fight a monster your own mind begins to corrupt, little by little. Campfires found on your journey are an opportunity to heal your wounds and reset your rising Psychosis.\u00a0</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3735860?t=1773483137","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3735860?t=1773483137","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3735860/ffdd37566599df0a0f18740b95fc3fc198b2c377/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1773483137","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3735860/ffdd37566599df0a0f18740b95fc3fc198b2c377/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1773483137","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Camera Comfort","id":67},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3735860/extras/c84eb145d76dc3080d5180368699c85b.poster.avif?t=1773483137\" width=920 height=518 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3735860/extras/c84eb145d76dc3080d5180368699c85b.webm?t=1773483137\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3735860/extras/c84eb145d76dc3080d5180368699c85b.mp4?t=1773483137\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3735860/extras/d3f9e6938c26ef07bcd235d141843274.avif?t=1773483137\" width=1600 height=400 /></span>An Ever-Changing World</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Lands of Marana are five continents filled with dangerous monsters, challenging bosses, and mysterious secrets. Every choice you make will change the fates of all characters and foes as the world shifts and your story gets written.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3735860/extras/0eff10ef04236a7d374c4b9d7a59e0df.avif?t=1773483137\" width=1600 height=400 /></span>Differences in Combat</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each class in Havoc Heirs offers unique abilities that separate their playstyles. Powerful rings that can be equipped and permanent Blessings that can be acquired further offer a wide variety of playable builds. </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3735860/extras/cb8a908e3f45f764e5ec313e3e9f8999.avif?t=1773483137\" width=1600 height=400 /></span>A Heavy Heart and Heavier Mind</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Monsters have had their minds corrupted by Psychosis, a dark force that makes them vicious and unyielding. Every time you fight a monster your own mind begins to corrupt, little by little. Campfires found on your journey are an opportunity to heal your wounds and reset your rising Psychosis.\u00a0</p>","developers":["Jay Sugarman"],"genres":[{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"RPG","id":"3"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3735860/ba353bf9d0e2377fc76898584cf2c195f2b2904f/header.jpg?t=1773483137","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3